# PulseVision: AI-Powered Non-Contact Heart Rate & Health Assessment System

PulseVision is an end-to-end AI-based remote Photoplethysmography (**rPPG**) physiological monitoring and health-assessment platform. It extracts subtle blood-volume micro-color variations from facial video in real-time to compute heart rate in beats per minute (BPM), estimate stress and fatigue (via Eye Aspect Ratio and blink dynamics), and deliver structured health reports with SMS dispatch and smartwatch accuracy validation.

