## Proposed Changes

### Backend Components (`/backend`)

#### [NEW] [`backend/app.py`](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/OneDrive/文件/Desktop/PULSEVISION-AI%20HEART%20MONITORING%20SYSTEM/backend/app.py)
- Flask API server with endpoints for:
  - `/api/auth/register`, `/api/auth/login`, `/api/auth/user`
  - `/api/process-frame` (real-time video frame processing with ROI extraction, lighting/stability checks)
  - `/api/estimate-rppg` (dual-mode: CHROM/POS signal processing vs PyTorch Deep Learning TSCAN)
  - `/api/fatigue-stress` (computes Eye Aspect Ratio, blink frequency, and pulse variability stress index)
  - `/api/send-sms` (SMS dispatch of health report summary to registered phone number)
  - `/api/validation/trials` (stores & calculates accuracy stats: MAE, RMSE, Pearson correlation vs smartwatch)
  - `/api/reports` (persisting and fetching previous health scans)

#### [NEW] [`backend/rppg_engine.py`](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/OneDrive/文件/Desktop/PULSEVISION-AI%20HEART%20MONITORING%20SYSTEM/backend/rppg_engine.py)
- **Computer Vision ROI Extraction**: Forehead, Left Cheek, Right Cheek bounding coordinates from MediaPipe/OpenCV landmarks.
- **Signal Pre-Processing**: RGB temporal signal buffer, detrending, normalized color differences.
- **Classical rPPG Methods**:
  - **POS (Plane-Orthogonal-to-Skin)**: Projection of skin color signals on orthogonal planes to eliminate specular reflection and motion artifacts.
  - **CHROM (Chrominance method)**: Linear combination of chrominance signals $3R - 2G$ and $1.5R + G - 1.5B$ with adaptive ratio weighting.
  - **Green Channel Filtering**: Peak detection benchmark.
- **Filtering & Spectral Analysis**:
  - 4th-order Butterworth bandpass filter (0.75 Hz to 3.5 Hz $\rightarrow$ 45 to 210 BPM).
  - Fast Fourier Transform (FFT) Power Spectral Density with Welch PSD estimation.
  - Signal-to-Noise Ratio (SNR) and Signal Quality Index (SQI) scoring.
  - **Low Signal Quality Rejection Filter**: Drops noisy frames/scans and outputs *"Low signal quality. Please remain still and face the camera."*

#### [NEW] [`backend/model.py`](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/OneDrive/文件/Desktop/PULSEVISION-AI%20HEART%20MONITORING%20SYSTEM/backend/model.py)
- PyTorch **TSCAN** (Temporal Convolutional Attention Network) / 1D-CNN + Spatial-Temporal Attention architecture for pulse extraction from multi-ROI color time series.
- Model serialization and loading logic (`models/rppg_tscan_best.pth`).

#### [NEW] [`backend/train_rppg.py`](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/OneDrive/文件/Desktop/PULSEVISION-AI%20HEART%20MONITORING%20SYSTEM/backend/train_rppg.py)
- Training, validation, and testing dataset pipeline.
- Synthetic and physiological rPPG dataset generator / loader.
- Metrics evaluation computation:
  - **MAE** (Mean Absolute Error)
  - **RMSE** (Root Mean Squared Error)
  - **Pearson Correlation ($r$)**
- Checkpoint saving to `backend/models/`.

#### [NEW] [`backend/fatigue_stress.py`](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/OneDrive/文件/Desktop/PULSEVISION-AI%20HEART%20MONITORING%20SYSTEM/backend/fatigue_stress.py)
- **Eye Aspect Ratio (EAR)** calculation on 6 key landmark points per eye:
  $$\text{EAR} = \frac{\|p_2 - p_6\| + \|p_3 - p_5\|}{2 \cdot \|p_1 - p_4\|}$$
- Blink rate detector and PERCLOS (percentage of eye closure time).
- Heart rate variability (HRV) time-domain proxy + micro-facial motion variance for stress index scoring (0 - 100).

#### [NEW] [`backend/sms_service.py`](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/OneDrive/文件/Desktop/PULSEVISION-AI%20HEART%20MONITORING%20SYSTEM/backend/sms_service.py)
- Handles SMS message construction with emoji classification (😊 Normal, ⚠️ Warning).
- Supports Twilio API credentials or fallback to an in-memory/disk message dispatcher log.

#### [NEW] [`backend/database.py`](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/OneDrive/文件/Desktop/PULSEVISION-AI%20HEART%20MONITORING%20SYSTEM/backend/database.py)
